# Input for twine.txt, the hash-pinned requirements that release.yml's verify-linux job
# installs with `pip install --require-hashes --only-binary :all:` to run `twine check --strict`.
# Regenerate twine.txt with the command in its header, moving --exclude-newer forward so that
# every pin stays at least 7 days old (the Dependabot cooldown).
twine==7.0.0
